  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EU Support to Migration Management  - Strengthening Migration Management and Border Control</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project has an overall objective to contribute to improved border and migration management in the Republic of Serbia in line with EU standards with an aim to facilitate the orderly movement of people and goods while increasing European security. This shall be achieved by strengthening the capabilities of relevant sections within the Serbian Ministry of Interior in the systematic process of registration, identification and assistance to irregular migrants and logistic support to the joint work of the national and the EU border police officers in order to prevent migrant smuggling and other forms of cross border organised crime.</narrative>
  </description>
